# OnboardBox

- Read `/docs` before substantial product or architecture changes.
- JMCG + clients only — not multi-agency SaaS.
- Orchestrate existing tools; do not replace DocuSign, Stripe, or ad platforms.
- Never store provider passwords or raw card data.
- Enforce company-scoped tenant isolation server-side.
- Same client nav: Home, Onboarding, Reporting, Approvals, Files, Billing, Account.
- Out of scope: CRM, chat, AI summaries, lead records, native apps.
- Stub Google/Meta OAuth, email, and reporting behind service boundaries until real keys exist.
- DocuSign + Stripe orchestration come last in the V1 build order.
